  Your Question Answered

  "How will CLAUDE.md play a role in code review?"

  Answer:
  1. CLAUDE.md stores the "what" - What standards must be followed
  2. Skills define the "how" - How to perform code review workflow
  3. Agents provide the "expertise" - Deep Spring Boot knowledge
  4. Rules enforce the "where" - Path-specific requirements

  All of them reference CLAUDE.md as the source of truth.

  When you run a code review:
  - Skill orchestrates the process
  - Agent does the analysis
  - Both check against CLAUDE.md standards
  - Rules add path-specific checks
  - You get comprehensive, consistent feedback

